---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "@/components/container.astro";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service" description="Terms of Service for PgDesigner — open-source visual PostgreSQL schema designer by vmkteam, and its paid support subscriptions.">
  <Container>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto pt-16 pb-24 prose-custom">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-heading">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Last updated: November 5, 2026</p>

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-heading mb-3">1. Overview</h2>
          <p>
            These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of PgDesigner, a visual PostgreSQL schema designer
            ("Software"), and the website <a href="https://pgdesigner.io" class="text-accent-text hover:underline">pgdesigner.io</a>
            ("Website"), operated by MyShows Inc. ("we", "us", "our").
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            "vmkteam" and "PgDesigner" are trade names of MyShows Inc., a Delaware corporation.
            All references to "vmkteam" on this Website and in related materials refer to MyShows Inc.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            By using the Website or by purchasing a support subscription, you agree to these Terms.
            Your use of the Software itself is governed by its open-source license (Section 2).
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-heading mb-3">2. License</h2>
          <p>
            The Software is open source and licensed under the
            <a href="https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent-text hover:underline">Apache License, Version 2.0</a>.
            You may use, copy, modify, and distribute the Software free of charge for any purpose, including commercial use,
            under the terms of that license. This applies to all releases of the Software, including releases previously
            distributed under the PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            If these Terms conflict with the Apache License 2.0 regarding your rights to the Software, the Apache License 2.0 prevails.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-heading mb-3">3. Support Subscriptions</h2>
          <p>
            We offer optional paid support subscriptions. A subscription buys access to our support services; it is not required
            to use the Software and does not change the license of the Software.
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-2 ml-4 list-disc space-y-1">
            <li><strong>Priority Support</strong> — $149/year per company: private email support with a response within 2 business days,
              priority handling of bugs reported by your team, and help with migrating existing models.</li>
            <li><strong>Enterprise Support</strong> — from $990/year, by agreement: response within 1 business day, a private chat channel,
              an onboarding call, and payment by invoice or purchase order.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Response times are targets measured in business days and do not guarantee a fix within that time.
            Sponsored development of new features is available on a separate quote.
            See the <a href="/pricing" class="text-accent-text hover:underline">Pricing page</a> for current details.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Subscriptions renew annually until cancelled. You can cancel at any time; support continues until the end of the paid period.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Payments are processed by <a href="https://stripe.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent-text hover:underline">Stripe</a>.
            By making a purchase, you also agree to
            <a href="https://stripe.com/legal/consumer" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent-text hover:underline">Stripe's Consumer Terms</a>.
            Prices are listed in USD and may be subject to applicable taxes depending on your jurisdiction.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-heading mb-3">4. Refund Policy</h2>
          <p>
            We offer a <strong>30-day money-back guarantee</strong> on support subscriptions.
            If the subscription does not meet your needs, contact us at
            <a href="mailto:support@pgdesigner.io" class="text-accent-text hover:underline">support@pgdesigner.io</a>
            within 30 days of payment for a full refund — no questions asked.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-heading mb-3">5. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>
            The Software is licensed to you under the Apache License 2.0. The PgDesigner name and logo, documentation, and
            website content remain the intellectual property of MyShows Inc. The Apache License 2.0 does not grant permission
            to use the PgDesigner name or logo, except as required for reasonable and customary use in describing the origin
            of the Software. Forks and derived works should use a different name.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-heading mb-3">6. Data and Privacy</h2>
          <p>
            PgDesigner is an offline-first desktop application. Your schema files (.pgd) are stored locally on your machine.
            The Software does not require a cloud account, does not transmit your data to our servers,
            and does not include telemetry or analytics in the desktop application.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            For information about data collected through our Website, see our
            <a href="/privacy" class="text-accent-text hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-heading mb-3">7. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
          <p>
            The Software is provided "as is" without warranty of any kind, express or implied, including but not limited to
            the warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement.
            We do not warrant that the Software will be error-free or uninterrupted.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-heading mb-3">8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>
            To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, MyShows Inc. shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental,
            special, consequential, or punitive damages, or any loss of profits or data, arising out of or related to your
            use of the Software, even if we have been advised of the possibility of such damages.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Our total liability for any claim arising from these Terms shall not exceed the amount you paid us for support subscriptions
            in the twelve (12) months preceding the claim.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-heading mb-3">9. Changes to These Terms</h2>
          <p>
            We may update these Terms from time to time. The updated version will be posted on this page with a revised
            "Last updated" date. Continued use of the Website or support services after changes constitutes acceptance of the new Terms.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-heading mb-3">10. Governing Law</h2>
          <p>
            These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Delaware, United States,
            without regard to its conflict of law provisions.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-heading mb-3">11. Contact</h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions about these Terms, contact us at
            <a href="mailto:support@pgdesigner.io" class="text-accent-text hover:underline">support@pgdesigner.io</a>.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-muted">
            MyShows Inc.<br />
            2810 N Church St, PMB 92198<br />
            Wilmington, Delaware 19802-4447 USA
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Layout>
